      "statement": "For every input satisfying A1, the actual sole admitted typed arity-1 solve entry in canonical program.vscore.json returns exactly Σ_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m). Floor is toward negative infinity, including negative numerators, and the empty sum is zero. The formal contract requires universal refinement of this complete value proposition by the actual source under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3, together with typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only for that exact file and entry.",
